        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7614807",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Istoria",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761480701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761480701": {
            "id": "761480701",
            "speakerId": 22306,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "Once more, we return to this place...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480702"
            ]
          },
          "761480702": {
            "id": "761480702",
            "speakerId": 22306,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "The last time I came, by human lifespans, it must have been... many, many, many... generations ago.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480703"
            ]
          },
          "761480703": {
            "id": "761480703",
            "speakerId": 22306,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "Looks like we've all been cast back into the Apathic Interval.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480704"
            ]
          },
          "761480704": {
            "id": "761480704",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So how are we supposed to get out?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480705"
            ]
          },
          "761480705": {
            "id": "761480705",
            "speakerId": 22306,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "The usual way is through meditation — learning to master your mind and thoughts, and then letting go of every desire.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480706"
            ]
          },
          "761480706": {
            "id": "761480706",
            "speakerId": 22306,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "In short, we must maintain a state of complete emptiness.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480707"
            ]
          },
          "761480707": {
            "id": "761480707",
            "speakerId": 22306,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "Simply enough said. But depending on a person's nature and the strength of their desires, it can take anywhere from a few years to several centuries.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480708"
            ]
          },
          "761480708": {
            "id": "761480708",
            "speakerId": 22306,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "For someone like you who carries the fate of the world on your shoulders, your desires probably can't be cast aside... nor should they be.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480709"
            ]
          },
          "761480709": {
            "id": "761480709",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Then what do we do?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480710"
            ]
          },
          "761480710": {
            "id": "761480710",
            "speakerId": 22306,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "Let's find Zeitlind, and figure it out from there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480711"
            ]
          },
          "761480711": {
            "id": "761480711",
            "speakerId": 22438,
            "speakerName": "Dex",
            "text": "!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480712"
            ]
          },
          "761480712": {
            "id": "761480712",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What'd you pick up?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480713"
            ]
          },
          "761480713": {
            "id": "761480713",
            "speakerId": 22306,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "Wait, Dex was dragged in as well?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480714"
            ]
          },
          "761480714": {
            "id": "761480714",
            "speakerId": 22306,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "In that case, there may yet be a chance to turn this around.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480715"
            ]
          },
          "761480715": {
            "id": "761480715",
            "speakerId": 22306,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "Since Dex is also a Watcher, it might be able to use the power contained within these fragments to force open a path.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480716"
            ]
          },
          "761480716": {
            "id": "761480716",
            "speakerId": 22306,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "We're going to need to give these fragments a name.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480717"
            ]
          },
          "761480717": {
            "id": "761480717",
            "speakerId": 22306,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "I've heard of these overwrought coffins. They were set up by one of the temple mistress's sisters... Maranasati Caskets, I believe they were called.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761480718"
            ]
          },
          "761480718": {
            "id": "761480718",
            "speakerId": 22306,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "In which case, let's call the fragments Deathmuse Shards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
